OL,3,A'Cyber incident' forces Department for
OL,4,AWork and Pensions to take some services
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome Department for Work and Pensions
OL,8,Fservices have been taken offline due to
OL,9,Fa "cyber incident affecting our
OL,10,Fsystems"
OL,12,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,13,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,14,Fnormal, the department says, adding the
OL,15,Fmove has been taken as a "precaution"
OL,17,FThe nature of the incident isn't clear,
OL,18,Fincluding whether personal data has
OL,19,Fbeen accessed
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
