OL,3,AGerman boat dealer suspected of
OL,4,Asupplying Channel smuggling gangs, BBC
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe managing director, Marvin Reuter,
OL,8,Fis contesting extradition to France,
OL,9,Fwhere he could face smuggling, criminal
OL,10,Fconspiracy and involuntary manslaughter
OL,11,Fcharges.
OL,13,FHis equipment is suspected of being
OL,14,Flinked to two fatal accidents, in which
OL,15,Ffour men died.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
